{"verse":22,"translation":"And You gave them kingdoms and peoples, and divided them to the corner; and they possessed ⟨את⟩ the land of Sihon, and ⟨את⟩ the land of the king of Heshbon, and ⟨את⟩ the land of Og king of Bashan.","tokens":[{"surface":"ותתן","gloss":"And You gave"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"them"},{"surface":"ממלכות","gloss":"kingdoms"},{"surface":"ועממים","gloss":"and peoples"},{"surface":"ותחלקם","gloss":"and divided them","readings":["and divided them","and allotted them"]},{"surface":"לפאה","gloss":"to the corner","readings":["to the corner","to the border"]},{"surface":"ויירשו","gloss":"and they possessed","readings":["and they possessed","and they inherited"]},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"the land of"},{"surface":"סיחון","gloss":"Sihon"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"and ⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"the land of"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"the king of"},{"surface":"חשבון","gloss":"Heshbon"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"and ⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"the land of"},{"surface":"עוג","gloss":"Og"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"king of"},{"surface":"הבשן","gloss":"Bashan"}],"pass":"en5","judge":"glm-5.3"}